  "sources": {
    "meetings": [
      {
        "source_id": "g25-d73-meeting-src",
        "schema": "pneuma.source.meeting/v1",
        "provider": "mock",
        "meeting_id": "g25-d73-export-reader-check",
        "title": "第一条链的导出阅读核对",
        "started_at": "2026-05-13T10:18:00+08:00",
        "ended_at": "2026-05-13T10:56:00+08:00",
        "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai",
        "owner_participant_ids": ["g25p-lin"],
        "participants": [
          {"participant_id": "g25p-lin", "display_name": "林舟", "role": "product", "synthetic_address": "lin.zhou@seamlog.test"},
          {"participant_id": "g25p-wu", "display_name": "吴岚", "role": "manager", "synthetic_address": "lan.wu@bamboo.test"}
        ],
        "agenda": [
          {
            "agenda_id": "g25m-ag01",
            "text": "核对第一条预算变更链能否从导出回到原材料。",
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-ag-auth01", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:18:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}
          },
          {
            "agenda_id": "g25m-ag02",
            "text": "区分采购阅读问题与尚未完成的第二条材料替代链。",
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-ag-auth02", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:19:00+08:00", "author_role": "manager", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C02", "C06"]}}
          }
        ],
        "utterances": [
          {
            "utterance_id": "g25m-u01", "speaker_id": "g25p-lin", "started_at": "2026-05-13T10:18:00+08:00", "ended_at": "2026-05-13T10:20:10+08:00",
            "text": "我刚才还在看桌搭论坛，别人把显示器支架拍得像杂志页，我翻了半小时才想起约了你。现在把论坛关掉。今天只放第一条链的导出，不讨论上手时间，也不借这个窗口说别的链怎么样。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-auth01", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:18:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g25m-u02", "speaker_id": "g25p-wu", "started_at": "2026-05-13T10:20:18+08:00", "ended_at": "2026-05-13T10:22:45+08:00",
            "text": "这条可以回去。我从导出行点到那封改预算的邮件，又能看见现场会的位置和陈放后来留下的状态；三处没有被揉成一句话。就“能找到原话”而言，我认可它已经是一条可用的链。我是从导出首页进入，不是从你发给我的深链接进入；第一遍先误点了状态，退回去才看见邮件入口。这个过程没有改变链的来源，却说明首页把阅读先后藏得太深。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-auth02", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:20:18+08:00", "author_role": "manager", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g25m-u03", "speaker_id": "g25p-lin", "started_at": "2026-05-13T10:22:54+08:00", "ended_at": "2026-05-13T10:25:12+08:00",
            "text": "我保留了每一步各自的地址：提议仍指向邮件，范围怎么落定仍指向会议，当前状态仍指向陈放的记录。导出只是把这些入口排在同一条记录旁，不把后来的人名和时间倒写回前一份材料。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-auth03", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:22:54+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g25m-u04", "speaker_id": "g25p-wu", "started_at": "2026-05-13T10:25:20+08:00", "ended_at": "2026-05-13T10:28:04+08:00",
            "text": "问题不在能不能点开，在采购的人第一次看这行时不知道自己该先读什么。现在左边是编号和短状态，右边挤着三个跳转；他看不出这是预算调整、影响了哪一段，还是谁把它留成待确认。格式对内部熟人够用，对采购不直观。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-auth04", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:25:20+08:00", "author_role": "manager", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g25m-u05", "speaker_id": "g25p-lin", "started_at": "2026-05-13T10:28:12+08:00", "ended_at": "2026-05-13T10:30:36+08:00",
            "text": "我当时怕标题太长，把“提出内容”“现场范围”“当前状态”缩成了三个代号。代号省了宽度，却把阅读顺序交给人猜。打印出来以后，三个代号旁也没有任何可辨认的来源名称，采购必须回电脑逐个试。我可以让第一列先说明这是一项预算变更，再把三个入口改成带动作的短标题；底层链接和记录顺序不动。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-auth05", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:28:12+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g25m-u06", "speaker_id": "g25p-wu", "started_at": "2026-05-13T10:30:42+08:00", "ended_at": "2026-05-13T10:33:10+08:00",
            "text": "等一下，别把“预算变更”做成替代原话的摘要。采购先需要一个能认路的标题，随后才决定要不要点回原材料。标题可以说这行处理的对象和现在停在哪，不能替邮件概括原因，更不能把陈放的待确认写成已经结案。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": "g25m-u05",
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-auth06", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:30:42+08:00", "author_role": "manager", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g25m-u07", "speaker_id": "g25p-lin", "started_at": "2026-05-13T10:33:18+08:00", "ended_at": "2026-05-13T10:35:42+08:00",
            "text": "那标题只写“预算调整记录”，下面分出“最初提出”“范围在会上说明”“当前状态待确认”三块。每块后面都是原记录入口，不在导出里重讲邮件正文。我会把状态的留存人单列出来，让读者知道这不是系统自己判的。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-auth07", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:33:18+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g25m-u08", "speaker_id": "g25p-wu", "started_at": "2026-05-13T10:35:50+08:00", "ended_at": "2026-05-13T10:38:18+08:00",
            "text": "这能解决我说的阅读问题，但不是签字，也不是验收。采购还会问第二条材料替代记录能不能同样读懂；它今天没有在这张导出里出现，你不能因为第一条排得清楚就替第二条找一个完成状态。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-auth08", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:35:50+08:00", "author_role": "manager", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C06"]}}
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g25m-u09", "speaker_id": "g25p-lin", "started_at": "2026-05-13T10:38:26+08:00", "ended_at": "2026-05-13T10:41:02+08:00",
            "text": "明白。今天的修订范围只有字段标题、分组顺序和跳转标签。我会在版本说明里标出“仅改变阅读层”，这样以后有人拿旧导出对照时，能知道地址、来源和状态值没有被这次排版改写。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-auth09", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:38:26+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g25m-u10", "speaker_id": "g25p-wu", "started_at": "2026-05-13T10:41:10+08:00", "ended_at": "2026-05-13T10:43:28+08:00",
            "text": "还有一件小事：如果采购只打印第一页，他至少得看见这行为什么被列出来、影响的是预算而不是供应商审批、以及状态还由谁等着确认。原材料可以留给跳转，第一页不能只剩技术编号。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-auth10", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:41:10+08:00", "author_role": "manager", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g25m-u11", "speaker_id": "g25p-lin", "started_at": "2026-05-13T10:43:36+08:00", "ended_at": "2026-05-13T10:46:06+08:00",
            "text": "我会把“本页不含供应商审批”放在阅读说明，而不是塞进这条记录的状态。记录本身显示对象、预算范围、来源入口和待确认的留存人；阅读说明再告诉采购哪些类型没有进入这次试点，避免把排除项误当成缺页。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-auth11", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:43:36+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g25m-u12", "speaker_id": "g25p-wu", "started_at": "2026-05-13T10:46:14+08:00", "ended_at": "2026-05-13T10:48:31+08:00",
            "text": "可以先这样改。我之后只看这条链的导出是否让采购读得明白，不替你测新的上手路径。第二条链、删除演练和付款都还是别的问题；不要在更新说明里把它们写成下一步已经排定的承诺。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-auth12", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:46:14+08:00", "author_role": "manager", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C03", "C04", "C06"]}}
          },
          {
            "utterance_id": "g25m-u13", "speaker_id": "g25p-lin", "started_at": "2026-05-13T10:48:40+08:00", "ended_at": "2026-05-13T10:50:58+08:00",
            "text": "我先交两份不同东西：一份是导出字段的修订稿，一份是按采购视角走一遍的阅读记录。若阅读记录仍让人停在代号上，我就继续改文字；若跳转本身有问题，再另开来源修正，不把两类问题混在这次标题调整里。阅读记录还会留下读者先看了哪一列、在哪个标题下停住、是否真的点开来源；它只收集阅读摩擦，不替采购补一个结论。若有人能找到邮件却把会议入口误当成批准记录，也要原样记下这种误读，方便把问题归在标题或顺序，而不是事后重写材料。",
            "interruption_of_utterance_id": null,
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-auth13", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:48:40+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}
          }
        ],
        "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25m-src-auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-13T10:18:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D73"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C06"]}}
      }
    ],
