            "messages": [
              {"message_id": "g25i-work-01", "sender_id": "g25-person-chenfang", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T09:12:00+08:00", "full_text": "我看了你昨晚发的入口。你说要把首次成功压到二十分钟，计时从哪里算？如果我还在想要不要建项目、找同事、补背景，那些时间要不要算进去？", "thread_id": null, "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-work-auth01", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T09:12:00+08:00", "author_role": "operations", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-work-02", "sender_id": "g25u-lin", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T09:16:00+08:00", "full_text": "从你选定一段变更材料、进入导入页开始算；终点是那一段被放进链里，并由你明确留下一次状态。不是建项目，也不是读完全部说明，更不是把后续材料一起整理完。", "thread_id": "g25i-work-01", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-work-auth02", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T09:16:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-work-03", "sender_id": "g25-person-chenfang", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T09:21:00+08:00", "full_text": "那我会先问一个很实际的问题：这一段材料从哪儿来。若页面在我开始前就要我选项目归属、加协作者、解释背景，我还是会停在那三格，不会因为后面有状态按钮就知道该怎么走。", "thread_id": "g25i-work-01", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-work-auth03", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T09:21:00+08:00", "author_role": "operations", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-work-04", "sender_id": "g25u-lin", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T09:27:00+08:00", "full_text": "这正是我要删的三步：预先选择项目归属、先邀请协作者、以及先写背景说明。它们可以在一段变更和状态已经留下后再出现；今天的路径不要求你替整套项目建框架。", "thread_id": "g25i-work-03", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-work-auth04", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T09:27:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-work-05", "sender_id": "g25-person-chenfang", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T09:34:00+08:00", "full_text": "删掉以后，我看见的是材料片段、它来自哪里、和一个状态选择。状态选择旁要让我知道这次是我在留下判断，不是系统看了材料以后自动替我判。否则我会把最后一步当成结果展示。", "thread_id": "g25i-work-03", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-work-auth05", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T09:34:00+08:00", "author_role": "operations", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C02", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-work-06", "sender_id": "g25u-lin", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T09:40:00+08:00", "full_text": "我会把状态前面的句子改成“由你留下当前判断”，并在旁边放回来源的位置。消息里也只给你这一个私聊和今天的材料片段，不把别的频道、历史文件或无关人员混进测试记录。", "thread_id": "g25i-work-05", "edited_at": "2026-05-14T09:43:00+08:00", "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-work-auth06", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T09:43:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C05", "C02", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-work-07", "sender_id": "g25-person-chenfang", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T09:49:00+08:00", "full_text": "好。二十分钟是这次要检查的目标，不是我现在已经跑出来的结果。我下午可以拿一段已经允许测试的材料走一遍；如果在来源或状态处停住，我只回你停在哪个词和页面。", "thread_id": "g25i-work-01", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-work-auth07", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T09:49:00+08:00", "author_role": "operations", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-work-08", "sender_id": "g25u-lin", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T09:55:00+08:00", "full_text": "收到。我只记录开始时间、材料片段、到状态前后的动作和你是否能说清状态是谁留下的。没有必要把第二条链也塞进今天的试走；它需要自己的材料和后续确认。", "thread_id": "g25i-work-07", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-work-auth08", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T09:55:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-work-09", "sender_id": "g25-person-chenfang", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T10:03:00+08:00", "full_text": "还有，不要把这次试走和删除演练混在一起。我可以确认我眼前的状态是怎么留下的，不能替谁签删除，也不知道采购那边什么时候会问尾款。", "thread_id": "g25i-work-07", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-work-auth09", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T10:03:00+08:00", "author_role": "operations", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C03", "C04", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-work-10", "sender_id": "g25u-lin", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T10:09:00+08:00", "full_text": "同意。页面里不放删除签字，也不写付款日期。先把三个可选步骤移到后面，再把“导入一段变更并确认状态”作为唯一完成描述；试走之后再看它是不是仍然让人绕路。", "thread_id": "g25i-work-09", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-work-auth10", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T10:09:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C03", "C04", "C06"]}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-work-11", "sender_id": "g25-person-chenfang", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T10:14:00+08:00", "full_text": "我下午只给你一次真实的停点反馈，不替路径写好评。要是我二十分钟内走完，也只能说明这段材料在这版页面里走得通；后面的确认人和其他链还是空着。", "thread_id": "g25i-work-10", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-work-auth11", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T10:14:00+08:00", "author_role": "operations", "content_class": "ambiguous", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C06"]}}}
            ],
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-work-conv-auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T09:12:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C06"]}}
          }
        ],
        "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-work-src-auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T09:12:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "signal", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": ["F13"], "continuity_ids": ["C02", "C06"]}}
