        "conversations": [
          {
            "conversation_id": "g25i-life-conv", "conversation_type": "dm", "title": "袜子和门口快递", "member_ids": ["g25u-lin-life", "g25u-zhao"],
            "messages": [
              {"message_id": "g25i-life-01", "sender_id": "g25u-zhao", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T17:18:00+08:00", "full_text": "你下楼买袜子的话顺便看看门口柜子？我有个小箱子卡在二号柜，取件码像是又发到旧手机去了。", "thread_id": null, "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-life-auth01", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T17:18:00+08:00", "author_role": "design", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-life-02", "sender_id": "g25u-lin-life", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T17:24:00+08:00", "full_text": "我正去买跑步袜，柜子在路边那排对吧？我先问驿站能不能按尾号找，找不到你晚点把新号码补给他们。", "thread_id": "g25i-life-01", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-life-auth02", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T17:24:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-life-03", "sender_id": "g25u-zhao", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T17:31:00+08:00", "full_text": "对，靠奶茶店那边。别买一堆花色的，上次那双薄袜洗一次就往脚跟跑。你自己挑深色的，省得明早又翻抽屉。", "thread_id": "g25i-life-01", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-life-auth03", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T17:31:00+08:00", "author_role": "design", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-life-04", "sender_id": "g25u-lin-life", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T17:47:00+08:00", "full_text": "柜门开了，箱子比想象的小。我买了两双灰的和一双黑的，没拿那种脚底写大字的。到家先把你的箱子放鞋柜上。", "thread_id": "g25i-life-01", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-life-auth04", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T17:47:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-life-05", "sender_id": "g25u-zhao", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T18:02:00+08:00", "full_text": "谢谢。箱子里应该是转接头，别压在伞下面。晚饭我煮面，你回来要是还饿就把冰箱那半盒番茄切了。", "thread_id": "g25i-life-01", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-life-auth05", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T18:02:00+08:00", "author_role": "design", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-life-06", "sender_id": "g25u-lin-life", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T18:16:00+08:00", "full_text": "好，我到楼下了。袜子包装纸我带下去扔，番茄别先切，今天那把小刀不太利，我回来处理。", "thread_id": "g25i-life-05", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-life-auth06", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T18:16:00+08:00", "author_role": "product", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}},
              {"message_id": "g25i-life-07", "sender_id": "g25u-zhao", "sent_at": "2026-05-14T18:19:00+08:00", "full_text": "行，面先下锅。转接头我自己试，不通再说；你上来记得把箱子的胶带也一起带走。", "thread_id": "g25i-life-05", "edited_at": null, "reactions": [], "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-life-auth07", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T18:19:00+08:00", "author_role": "design", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}}
            ],
            "authorship": {"authored_id": "g25i-life-conv-auth", "occurred_at": "2026-05-14T17:18:00+08:00", "author_role": "design", "content_class": "noise", "links": {"story_beat_ids": ["D74"], "fact_ids": [], "continuity_ids": []}}
          }
        ],
